# data/fixtures/golden_box.obj — hand-authored golden mesh fixture (SPEC section 7).
#
# Unit cube spanning [0,1]^3. Hand-counted acceptance constants (verified in
# data/README.md and consumed by the io/ data tests, FR-io.1/FR-data.1/FR-data.2
# and the MPR contour test FR-app.3):
#   vertices : 8
#   faces    : 12 (triangles)
#   AABB     : min (0,0,0), max (1,1,1)
# Each face's vertices are wound so the right-hand-rule normal
# cross(b-a, c-a) is the outward unit normal (see the per-face comment).
#
# Vertex table:
#   1 (0,0,0)  2 (1,0,0)  3 (1,1,0)  4 (0,1,0)
#   5 (0,0,1)  6 (1,0,1)  7 (1,1,1)  8 (0,1,1)

v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
v 1 1 0
v 0 1 0
v 0 0 1
v 1 0 1
v 1 1 1
v 0 1 1

# bottom face (z=0), outward normal (0,0,-1)
f 1 4 3
f 1 3 2
# top face (z=1), outward normal (0,0,1)
f 5 6 7
f 5 7 8
# front face (y=0), outward normal (0,-1,0)
f 1 6 5
f 1 2 6
# back face (y=1), outward normal (0,1,0)
f 4 8 7
f 4 7 3
# left face (x=0), outward normal (-1,0,0)
f 1 5 8
f 1 8 4
# right face (x=1), outward normal (1,0,0)
f 2 3 7
f 2 7 6
